<title>USA: America West Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>America West Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $1.03   profit	 $0.46</p>
<p> Net	   loss	45,707   profit	21,715</p>
<p> Revs		     422,518		  408,627</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  44,381		   48,728</p>
<p>	  Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.07   profit	 $1.04</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   3,563   profit	47,798</p>
<p> Revs		   1,299,617		1,154,333</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  47,774		   46,354</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 third quarter includes a pre-tax charge of $65 million for a decision to order new aircraft and cancel a prior order and a decision to reflect current asset values for certain inventories and facilities and other adjustments.</p>
<p>Excluding the charge, third quarter pre-tax earnings were $3.6 million.</p>
<p>America West Airlines Inc.</p>
</text>
